{"seq":3,"slug":"jiang-zemin-biography","title":"江泽民：生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"jiang-zemin","categoryLabel":"江泽民","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography","rating":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/04_jiang-zemin/3_jiang-zemin-biography","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"江泽民-生平与时代\">江泽民：生平与时代</h1><p>江泽民（1926年8月17日—2022年11月30日）是中华人民共和国第三代中央领导集体的核心。本 hub 是江泽民专题中的<strong>人物传记</strong>读本：以编年为经、专题为纬，完整讲述一个人从扬州书香门第的少年，到电机工程师、技术官僚，再到1989年被推上最高领导岗位、主政中国十余年、直至2022年逝世的一生。它回答四个问题——<strong>他是谁？他如何走到权力中心？他在任十三年间发生了什么？他身后留下了怎样的评价与争议？</strong></p>\n<p>如果你要找的不是人物生平，请先看下方的分工边界，避免走错入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>「江泽民」专题下共设五个 hub，视角互补、内容各有侧重而非重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>回答的核心问题</th>\n<th>什么时候读它</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>本 hub：生平与时代</strong></td>\n<td>人物传记 + 编年</td>\n<td>这个人的一生轨迹与其执政时代的重大事件</td>\n<td>想沿时间线完整了解其人其事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../jiang-zemin-thought/\">江泽民思想概论</a></td>\n<td>思想与治理逻辑</td>\n<td>时代提出了什么课题、形成什么理论、如何转化为政策</td>\n<td>想理解政策设计背后的思想逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../three-represents/\">三个代表重要思想</a></td>\n<td>单一理论深挖</td>\n<td>&quot;三个代表&quot;的提出背景、内涵结构与历史评价</td>\n<td>想专门吃透这一个理论命题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../jiang-zemin-political-rise/\">江泽民：从政之路与权力崛起</a></td>\n<td>政治进程史</td>\n<td>技术官僚如何一步步完成权力崛起与权威巩固</td>\n<td>想细抠权力运作、人事与派系脉络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../jiang-zemin-legacy/\">江泽民：历史影响与评价</a></td>\n<td>后世评价</td>\n<td>经济、外交、党建各领域遗产的长时段影响与主要争议</td>\n<td>想做跨领域的盖棺论定式综合评判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>本 hub 讲&quot;人的一生&quot;，思想 hub 讲&quot;治理的逻辑&quot;，三个代表 hub 讲&quot;一个理论的细节&quot;，崛起 hub 讲&quot;权力的路径&quot;，遗产 hub 讲&quot;身后的评说&quot;。</strong> 与本 hub 边界最近的是崛起 hub：本 hub 按&quot;生—起—治—退—逝&quot;的完整人生展开、权力只是其中一环；崛起 hub 则把镜头拉近到权力技术与决策过程本身。读完本 hub 第一章觉得&quot;还想往权力细节里钻&quot;，就转去崛起 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全书结构-三章八节\">全书结构：三章八节</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 早年生涯与崛起</strong>：<a href=\"early-life-and-rise/birth-family-education\">出身、家世与求学</a> · <a href=\"early-life-and-rise/engineer-and-shanghai-years\">工程师生涯与主政上海</a> · <a href=\"early-life-and-rise/ascent-to-power-1989\">1989年的权力交替</a></li>\n<li><strong>第二章 执政时代</strong>：<a href=\"era-of-leadership/socialist-market-economy\">社会主义市场经济的确立</a> · <a href=\"era-of-leadership/reunification-and-diplomacy\">国家统一与对外关系</a> · <a href=\"era-of-leadership/party-building-three-represents\">党的建设与&quot;三个代表&quot;重要思想</a></li>\n<li><strong>第三章 交班与身后</strong>：<a href=\"later-years-and-legacy/transition-and-retirement\">权力交接与晚年退休</a> · <a href=\"later-years-and-legacy/death-and-historical-assessment\">逝世与历史评价</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>每一节均配有时间线、对照表与结构图。叙述依据可查证的公开史料（出生与任职日期、会议决议、政策文件、公开讲话），并对成就与代价、官方表述与外部观察作并置呈现，不替读者下结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>一般历史读者（先搭骨架，约 3 篇）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"early-life-and-rise/birth-family-education\">出身、家世与求学</a> —— 此人从哪里来；</li>\n<li><a href=\"early-life-and-rise/ascent-to-power-1989\">1989年的权力交替</a> —— 他如何登上权力顶峰；</li>\n<li><a href=\"later-years-and-legacy/death-and-historical-assessment\">逝世与历史评价</a> —— 官方与外界各自如何盖棺。\n之后再按兴趣回填第二章任意一篇专题。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>关注经济改革的读者</strong>：<a href=\"era-of-leadership/socialist-market-economy\">社会主义市场经济的确立</a> → <a href=\"later-years-and-legacy/transition-and-retirement\">权力交接与晚年退休</a>，即&quot;十四大定目标 → 十六大切换班子&quot;的一条制度主线；想继续追理论源头，转去文末延伸阅读中的南方谈话专题。</p>\n<p><strong>关注外交与国家统一的读者</strong>：<a href=\"era-of-leadership/reunification-and-diplomacy\">国家统一与对外关系</a> → <a href=\"early-life-and-rise/engineer-and-shanghai-years\">工程师生涯与主政上海</a>，后者解释中俄战略协作的私人资本——留苏实习与俄语能力——从何而来。</p>\n<p><strong>政治学 / 当代史专业读者</strong>：按章序通读八篇；重点比对<a href=\"early-life-and-rise/ascent-to-power-1989\">1989年的权力交替</a>与<a href=\"later-years-and-legacy/transition-and-retirement\">权力交接与晚年退休</a>这组方向相反的权力交接案例；理论部分以<a href=\"era-of-leadership/party-building-three-represents\">党的建设与&quot;三个代表&quot;重要思想</a>为导引即可，命题级细节交给<a href=\"../three-represents/\">三个代表重要思想</a> hub。</p>\n<p><strong>时间有限的读者</strong>：每篇末尾的「小结」均可独立成摘要，八篇小结加本页结构清单即为最小可用版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必需</strong>：中国近现代史的基本坐标——1949 年建国、&quot;文革&quot;结束、1978 年十一届三中全会开启改革开放。缺这条时间轴，第一章的求学、入党与仕途节点都会失去参照。</li>\n<li><strong>强烈建议</strong>：知道邓小平理论与 1992 年南方谈话的大致内容。江泽民时代的经济路线是南方谈话的制度化延续，不了解前者，就读不出第二章经济一篇中&quot;谁定调、谁施工&quot;的分工。可先读<a href=\"../../deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/\">南方谈话专题</a>补课。</li>\n<li><strong>有帮助但非必需</strong>：冷战终结与苏联解体的国际背景——它是第二章外交线（中俄关系重建、中美数度危机）的共同语境。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>以下入口在本 hub 之外，供读完本 hub 后按需深入（本 hub 八篇正文均自足闭环，未依赖这些材料）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>深挖执政思想与政策逻辑 → <a href=\"../jiang-zemin-thought/\">江泽民思想概论</a></li>\n<li>吃透&quot;三个代表&quot;理论命题的全部细节 → <a href=\"../three-represents/\">三个代表重要思想</a></li>\n<li>细究权力崛起的政治过程 → <a href=\"../jiang-zemin-political-rise/\">江泽民：从政之路与权力崛起</a></li>\n<li>查看跨领域遗产与争议清单 → <a href=\"../jiang-zemin-legacy/\">江泽民：历史影响与评价</a></li>\n<li>追溯经济路线的理论源头 → <a href=\"../../deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/\">邓小平南方谈话</a></li>\n<li>把江泽民放回领导人思想演进谱系 → <a href=\"../../chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/\">思想谱系专题</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-rise","title":"早年生涯与从政之路","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/early-life-and-rise","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"birth-family-education","title":"出身、家世与求学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/early-life-and-rise/birth-family-education"},{"seq":2,"slug":"engineer-and-shanghai-years","title":"工程师生涯与主政上海","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/early-life-and-rise/engineer-and-shanghai-years"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ascent-to-power-1989","title":"1989年的权力交替","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/early-life-and-rise/ascent-to-power-1989"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"era-of-leadership","title":"执政时代与重大决策","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/era-of-leadership","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"socialist-market-economy","title":"社会主义市场经济的确立","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/era-of-leadership/socialist-market-economy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reunification-and-diplomacy","title":"国家统一与对外关系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/era-of-leadership/reunification-and-diplomacy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"party-building-three-represents","title":"党的建设与\"三个代表\"重要思想","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/era-of-leadership/party-building-three-represents"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"later-years-and-legacy","title":"晚年与历史评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/later-years-and-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transition-and-retirement","title":"权力交接与晚年退休","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/later-years-and-legacy/transition-and-retirement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"death-and-historical-assessment","title":"逝世与历史评价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-biography/later-years-and-legacy/death-and-historical-assessment"}]}]}